  "description": "\n    ThinkGeo.SqlServer targets .NET Framework 4.6.2+ and .NET Standard 2.1, compatible with modern .NET runtimes. It is a layer extension to the ThinkGeo product line that provides the ability to render Microsoft SQL Server Spatial data on a map.\n\n    This layer takes advantage of the Microsoft SQL server spatial extension as of SQL server 2008 allowing you to store data natively as geometries.\n\n    ** This is an extension for use in ThinkGeo's product line, and cannot be used standalone.  **\n\n    Docs and Product Guides: https://docs.thinkgeo.com/\n\n    This is a commercial product with a free 30-day evaluation.\n    Start your evaluation by signing up at https://helpdesk.thinkgeo.com/register and downloading the ProductCenter application.\n\n    Supported Platforms: Windows, Linux\n\n    Other ThinkGeo Products based on .NET:\n    ThinkGeo.UI.Maui\n    ThinkGeo.UI.Android\n    ThinkGeo.UI.iOS\n    ThinkGeo.UI.Blazor\n    ThinkGeo.UI.Wpf\n    ThinkGeo.UI.WinForms\n    ThinkGeo.GisServer\n  ",
